<title>AUSTRIA: Austria April unemployment rate rises to 4.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria April unemployment rate rises to 4.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian Social Affairs Ministry reported the following unemployment data on Thursday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	  APRIL 97  MARCH 97  APRIL 96</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	  4.4	  4.1	 4.2</p>
<p> Total				236,327    252,005   237,401</p>
<p>NOTE - The April 1997 figure is an extrapolation by the Austrian Labour Market Service from final Eurostat data for February.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
